    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/37695671de70c539511991c4d8f458c2.poster.avif?t=1752495140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/37695671de70c539511991c4d8f458c2.webm?t=1752495140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/37695671de70c539511991c4d8f458c2.mp4?t=1752495140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Traverse colorful landscapes in <strong>DunDun VR</strong>, from the red hot Goab Desert, through gloomy tunnels, a mystical lab...and beyond. Interact with odd objects, classified keys, eerie eyeballs, and big bold buttons. Immerse yourself in this short but sweet experience, enjoy a serene and atmospheric soundtrack, and don\u2019t forget to collect the eggs!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short &amp; surreal experience in VR<br></li><li>Part on-rails and part free roam (teleport or free movement)<br></li><li>An original soundtrack<br></li><li>Interact with odd objects, big bold buttons, and classified keys<br></li><li>Collect eggs<br></li><li>Playtime: 15-25 minutes</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE WHALES OF THE SKY</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/7664e9f8e9039d955600a0486f11d3c1.poster.avif?t=1752495140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/7664e9f8e9039d955600a0486f11d3c1.webm?t=1752495140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/7664e9f8e9039d955600a0486f11d3c1.mp4?t=1752495140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You decide the destiny of the poor flying apparatuses!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GO FOR THE THREE POINTER!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/58f8984089d3335e116dc9415f205161.poster.avif?t=1752495140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/58f8984089d3335e116dc9415f205161.webm?t=1752495140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/58f8984089d3335e116dc9415f205161.mp4?t=1752495140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Woooooahhhh, Kaboom!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PARTICIPATE IN A STARING CONTEST</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/ad1f116c0a3cc284b47764852c395774.poster.avif?t=1752495140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/ad1f116c0a3cc284b47764852c395774.webm?t=1752495140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/ad1f116c0a3cc284b47764852c395774.mp4?t=1752495140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The big watchful eye...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HYPERSPEED!</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/6c414698f1d09af2782c20ccad675efe.poster.avif?t=1752495140\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/6c414698f1d09af2782c20ccad675efe.webm?t=1752495140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1695870/extras/6c414698f1d09af2782c20ccad675efe.mp4?t=1752495140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Leave everything behind.",
